              <br/>
              <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">lagern, Erdplanum herstellen und verdichten -</span>
              <br/>
              <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Frostsichere Tragschicht aus Kies- oder</span>
              <br/>
              <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Steinbruchmaterial </span>
